From 38628adbdb3f01de7dd8fbdf5398829ef48537a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:39:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] linux-firmware: backport nord wlan firmware support

The current linux-firmware 20260910 version doesn't include the WLAN
firmware required by Nord platforms. Backport the upstream commit
e88807ffbf0f ("ath12k: WCN7850 hw2.0: update board-2.bin") to ensure
the required WCN7850 firmware files are picked up to enable WLAN
functionality on Nord boards.

The patch can be dropped once OE-Core updates linux-firmware to a
release that includes above commit.

Signed-off-by: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://gitlab.com/kernel-firmware/linux-firmware/-/commit/e88807ffbf0fce50130cf1f7475acfb8ba365c12]
---
 ...12k-WCN7850-hw2.0-update-board-2.bin.patch | 312 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../linux-firmware/linux-firmware_20260910.bb |   1 +
 2 files changed, 313 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-ath12k-WCN7850-hw2.0-update-board-2.bin.patch

diff --git a/meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-ath12k-WCN7850-hw2.0-update-board-2.bin.patch b/meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-ath12k-WCN7850-hw2.0-update-board-2.bin.patch
